PLE[2B[0m[38;2;175;215;135m⡆⠀[0m[5B[3A[2C[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[20A[J[38;2;124;124;124mThe problem asks: Is it possible to construct a strictly increasing sequence of [0m[38;2;124;124;124mordinals {β_n} such that each subformula of φ_n is absolute for V_{β_n}, using [0m
