[38;2;124;124;124mrecursively. The issue is whether the recursion theorem in ZFC allows this.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mActually, the recursion theorem in ZFC allows defining functions by recursion if[0m[38;2;124;124;124mthe recursion is given by a definable function. Here, β_n = f(n) where f is [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mdefined by: f(0) = some reflecting ordinal for φ_0, f(n+1) = the least [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mreflecting ordinal for φ_{n+1} greater than f(n).[0m

